{"id": "99210011", "name": "התפלגות גאומטרית – הטלת קובייה עד התוצאה הראשונה של 1", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מטילים קובייה הוגנת עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span> פאות (ממוספרות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1,\\ldots,{{CT:0}}\\)</span>) שוב ושוב, עד שמתקבל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1\\)</span> בפעם הראשונה. יהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> מספר ההטלות (כולל ההטלה האחרונה).</p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">א. חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}(X={{CT:1}})\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ב. חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}(X>{{CT:1}})\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> הוא מספר הניסויים עד ההצלחה הראשונה, ולכן הוא גאומטרי.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — ההתפלגות</b><br>כל הטלה היא ניסוי ברנולי עם הסתברות הצלחה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p=\\frac{1}{ {{CT:0}} }\\)</span>, וההטלות בלתי תלויות. לכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\sim\\mathrm{Geo}\\left(\\frac{1}{ {{CT:0}} }\\right)\\)</span>, ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}(X=k)=(1-p)^{k-1}p\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — בדיוק k</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X={{CT:1}}\\)</span> פירושו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span> כישלונות ואחריהם הצלחה:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}(X={{CT:1}})=\\left(\\frac{ {{CT:3}} }{ {{CT:0}} }\\right)^{ {{CT:2}} }\\cdot\\frac{1}{ {{CT:0}} }={{CT:4}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — יותר מ-k</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X>{{CT:1}}\\)</span> פירושו ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span> ההטלות הראשונות כולן כישלונות:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}(X>{{CT:1}})=\\left(\\frac{ {{CT:3}} }{ {{CT:0}} }\\right)^{ {{CT:1}} }={{CT:5}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "t1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "t2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "(1-pp)^(kk-1)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-T", "feedback": "<p>זו \\(\\mathbb{P}(X\\ge k)\\). המאורע \\(X>k\\) דורש כישלון גם בהטלה ה-\\(k\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["dd", "kk", "pp", "t1", "t2"], "nvariants": 30}